{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":276985,\"title\":\"West of Thunder\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"In 1899, a mysterious stranger's arrival on the outskirts of the Lakota Pine Ridge Reservation seems to coincide with a series of horrific events that closely mirror the atrocity brought to the Lakota natives during the Wounded Knee Massacre.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hfm9sabq0knPJrxFPiAWAj9d9J.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Western\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jody Marriott Bar-Lev\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3286669,\"name\":\"Jody Marriott Bar-Lev\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3703851,\"name\":\"Steve Russell\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1778774,\"name\":\"Dan Davies\",\"character\":\"Henry Seed\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ziyenFc9W4LBThH1MyLxgPBNiHq.jpg\"},{\"id\":1778775,\"name\":\"Clifford Henry\",\"character\":\"Sheriff Chapman\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1778776,\"name\":\"Corbin Conroy\",\"character\":\"Little Thunder\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1778777,\"name\":\"Steve Garcia\",\"character\":\"Charlie Little Feather\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1778778,\"name\":\"Larry Swalley\",\"character\":\"Minor Running Cloud\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1778779,\"name\":\"Albert Red-Bear\",\"character\":\"Red Wolf\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":84769,\"name\":\"Michael Worth\",\"character\":\"Kippy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uSE4dIBXhSWeQiFUoaYMG7jxdMo.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":273248,\"title\":\"The Hateful Eight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jIywvdPjia2t3eKYbjVTcwBQlG8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7g1zO5t0bd27Iqn5ZUDJmksOGPJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bounty hunters seek shelter from a raging blizzard and get caught up in a plot of betrayal and deception.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":427564,\"title\":\"Scooby-Doo! Shaggy's Showdown\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rqw4Cis6dliACGzaejR5icXjA52.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kEmUiByLncHy5tQTdNYDvom8UR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the Scooby gang visits a dude ranch, they discover that it and the nearby town have been haunted by a ghostly cowboy, Dapper Jack, who fires real fire from his fire irons. The mystery only deepens when it’s discovered that the ghost is also the long lost relative of Shaggy Rogers!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8053,\"title\":\"The Three Burials of Melquiades Estrada\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uHOEb6mo45qMSJaZqbkVa7oW1Y7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3n4Bfg390okuusER56enINib0kL.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When brash Texas border officer Mike Norton wrongfully kills and buries the friend and ranch hand of Pete Perkins, the latter is reminded of a promise he made to bury his friend, Melquiades Estrada, in his Mexican home town. He kidnaps Norton and exhumes Estrada's corpse, and the odd caravan sets out on horseback for Mexico.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446159,\"title\":\"Bacurau\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tBa4zMGzZUco26XT3WfZZCwQ76i.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nhsC7Q1Zb5n2p4H3UKy422zP5XC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bacurau, a small town in the Brazilian sertão, mourns the loss of its matriarch, Carmelita, who lived to be 94. Days later, its inhabitants notice that their community has vanished from most maps.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Western\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":541560,\"title\":\"The Wind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kcfPHZHSQODLCWdkUVLYATNyEVo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cy70DnmcGf1Vo9XKYrz2t8NUzMS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lizzy is a tough, resourceful frontierswoman settling a remote stretch of land on the 19th-century American frontier. Isolated from civilization in a desolate wilderness where the wind never stops howling, she begins to sense a sinister presence that seems to be borne of the land itself, and when a newlywed couple arrive at a nearby homestead, their presence amplifies Lizzy's fears, setting into motion a shocking chain of events.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":879990,\"title\":\"God's Country\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aZp190Qx33oRO8KGSkO1sFjEqC2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w1zCG16xT77PuRD3wZRGKVPPLHO.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a grieving college professor confronts two hunters she catches trespassing on her property, she's drawn into an escalating battle of wills with catastrophic consequences.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":262982,\"title\":\"The Hollow Point\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/I3nqs2RHuGNjhIHrU7yG3Ai0fc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r2Yysp0MUqhrVCkgHywzpzpXM2l.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Los Reyes County, Arizona. Leland, a retired lawman, works with Wallace, the new sheriff who replaces him, when a vicious hit man, sent by a Mexican drug cartel, threatens their border small town.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"uVEs9_mzLzA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"JMpHk4d1O7Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\